       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TOMIC-GRAND-SEAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GRAND-SEAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DEEP-SURFACE-EQUIV-SOUND PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REBAR-ZMM-PHRASE-ALIGNED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-MODULAR-CONGRU   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WINCHESTER-CHANNEL18-GAT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRAND-SOVEREIGN-SEAL-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GRAND-SEAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-GRAND-SEAL-PROVEN    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GRAND-SEAL-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EQUIVALENCE-AND-ZMM.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TOTIENT-AND-WINCHESTER.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GRAND-SEAL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EQUIVALENCE-AND-ZMM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DEEP-SURFACE-EQUIV-SOUND.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-ZMM-PHRASE-ALIGNED.
       2000-EVALUATE-TOTIENT-AND-WINCHESTER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-MODULAR-CONGRU.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WINCHESTER-CHANNEL18-GAT.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GRAND-SEAL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DEEP-SURFACE-EQUIV-SOUND = 1 AND
              WS-REBAR-ZMM-PHRASE-ALIGNED = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-MODULAR-CONGRU = 1 AND
              WS-WINCHESTER-CHANNEL18-GAT = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAND-SOVEREIGN-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-GRAND-SEAL-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAND-SEAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-GRAND-SEAL-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAND-SEAL-CODE.
